Hi Stefan, I'd like to check whether a small contribution in this area is still useful before opening a PR.

I noticed #332 and the recent visualization PRs #395, #396, #397, and #411 were closed or flagged, so I don't want to duplicate those or add to review noise. I have been looking at the `registernetplot_axis` / `get_slots_vis_string` path and a minimal scope would be:

- show the current node's queued `messagebuffer` contents in register/state hover or click inspection text;
- add a focused plotting regression test for queued message visibility;
- add a short note in `docs/src/visualizations.md`.

I cannot run Julia tests on my current machine yet, so I would only submit after verifying locally in a Julia environment. If this overlaps too much with #395/#332, I can drop this scope and look for a different, non-overlapping visualization task instead.
